{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parkour ninja who roams the night has arrived in a brand-new realm. A completely fresh roguelike setup will make the whole game more tense and thrilling than ever. Are you ready to take on this ever-changing challenge? Enjoy the adrenaline of lightning-fast movement and combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Parkour Assassin: Sprint Run 2!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/81a048c460b40d1d799535c0015ba12b.poster.avif?t=1768790734\" width=700 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/81a048c460b40d1d799535c0015ba12b.webm?t=1768790734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a legendary parkour adventure\u2014sprint across randomly generated tracks, slash through enemies and leap over obstacles with your blade like a true warrior, continuously pushing your distance limits to new heights~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike! Plus parkour? A true test of speed and reflexes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/edd1147d3ea86f4002ec61a4f0eac0e7.poster.avif?t=1768790734\" width=700 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/edd1147d3ea86f4002ec61a4f0eac0e7.webm?t=1768790734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/edd1147d3ea86f4002ec61a4f0eac0e7.mp4?t=1768790734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every parkour run offers a completely different experience. The game is packed with roguelike elements: random maps, random buffs, random traps, randomly generated enemies, and more! All you need to do is: make quick decisions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/b37df52faea5e92a330119d2c7e5d517.poster.avif?t=1768790734\" width=700 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/b37df52faea5e92a330119d2c7e5d517.webm?t=1768790734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also traverse diverse environments and challenge unique worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a ninja with skills and ultimate abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/7f8c0069b8075e46bcdb1358e87c4129.poster.avif?t=1768790734\" width=700 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/7f8c0069b8075e46bcdb1358e87c4129.webm?t=1768790734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064600/extras/7f8c0069b8075e46bcdb1358e87c4129.mp4?t=1768790734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, a vast array of cool skills will immerse you in an exhilarating parkour battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and choose from various awesome weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po